sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI
    participant C as PyodideWorkerClient
    participant W as PyodideWorker
    participant P as Python

    Note over P,W: Debug adds a pause channel<br/>that is not a request-response.

    UI->>C: debugCode(code, breakpoints)
    C->>W: postMessage({id, StartDebugCode})
    W->>P: runPythonAsync(code)

    P->>W: js.postMessage("OnDebugFileCreated")
    W->>C: postMessage(string) [no id]
    C->>UI: onDebugPaused callback

    UI->>C: debugContinue()
    C->>W: notify(DebugUserCommandContinue)
    W->>P: future.set_result(None)
